Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.00,0:03:34.30,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs54\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,24)}▍{\r\fn得意黑\fs54}2026 美网 女单第三轮
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.00,0:03:34.30,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38\c&H8CDC4A&\an8\pos(540,92)}郑钦文 {\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}1-{\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}6 {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}6{\r\fnTL Score\fs44}³ {\r\fnTL Score\c&H8CDC4A&\b1\fs44}7-{\r\fnTL Score\b300\fs44}5{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\fs38} 凯斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.40,EN,,0,0,0,,has watched something absolutely
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:02.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,美网这里刚刚上演了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:07.88,EN,,0,0,0,,remarkable here at the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:07.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,完全不可思议的一幕
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to help us understand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:11.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你得帮我们理解一下这场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.20,EN,,0,0,0,,this one because you were five love down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.12,0:00:13.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为决胜盘你 0-5 落后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,in the deciding set yet we stand here
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,而现在我们站在这里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.96,EN,,0,0,0,,on the back of a 7-5 victory
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.16,0:00:18.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,是因为你 7-5 拿下了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.96,EN,,0,0,0,,in the deciding set.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.96,0:00:20.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个决胜盘
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.88,EN,,0,0,0,,How did that just happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.96,0:00:22.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这到底是怎么发生的？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.72,EN,,0,0,0,,Remarkable story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.88,0:00:24.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,太不可思议了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, first of all, I have to say Madison Keys,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.72,0:00:27.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,首先我得说 凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,EN,,0,0,0,,she play amazing in that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:29.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,她那个时候打得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like she made 5-0
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.92,0:00:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我不觉得她能 5-0 领先
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.36,EN,,0,0,0,,because I play so bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.32,0:00:33.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,是因为我打得太差
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.20,EN,,0,0,0,,I think she play amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.36,0:00:35.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得是她打得好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.12,EN,,0,0,0,,And after I just telling myself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来我就一直告诉自己
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,keep holding every single point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.12,0:00:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,每一分都要咬住
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Never give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,永远别放弃
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Stay there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.60,0:00:40.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,就留在场上
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:43.36,EN,,0,0,0,,And somehow little by little it just
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.80,0:00:43.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,然后不知怎么 一点一点
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:43.76,EN,,0,0,0,,happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.36,0:00:43.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,它就真的发生了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:47.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, finally one time a bit luck
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.76,0:00:47.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,终于有那么一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,is on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.68,0:00:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,运气站在我这边
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:50.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm so happy. And I know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.64,0:00:50.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我太开心了 我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.68,EN,,0,0,0,,in the last match she also did that turn back
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.40,0:00:53.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,她上一场也完成过逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and it's not bad I did that once as well
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.68,0:00:56.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我这次也做到一次 挺好
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.68,EN,,0,0,0,,but honestly also this is first time happen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.72,0:00:59.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,但老实说 这是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in my career I turn up like 0-5 usually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.68,0:01:02.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,生涯里从 0-5 追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.44,EN,,0,0,0,,before it's always 1-5, 2-5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.64,0:01:05.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,以前最多是 1-5 或 2-5
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:08.96,EN,,0,0,0,,but yeah it was very dramatic match for me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.44,0:01:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球对我来说太跌宕
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:12.16,EN,,0,0,0,,but we both show up really strong tennis
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:12.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,但我们都打出了很强的球
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:13.36,EN,,0,0,0,,and I want to say thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.16,0:01:13.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想说声谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.32,EN,,0,0,0,,for the crowd who come
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.36,0:01:14.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢今天来现场的观众
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.40,EN,,0,0,0,,to supporting us today doesn't matter
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.32,0:01:16.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,来给我们加油 不管
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:19.76,EN,,0,0,0,,if it's supporting Maddie or me I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.40,0:01:19.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,你支持的是麦迪还是我
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.56,EN,,0,0,0,,thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.76,0:01:22.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,真的非常感谢
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.28,EN,,0,0,0,,This is truly one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.56,0:01:23.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,这真的是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.80,EN,,0,0,0,,of the loudest atmospheres we've had here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:24.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们见过气氛最热的一场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:26.88,EN,,0,0,0,,on Grandstand at this year's US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.80,0:01:26.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,今年美网 Grandstand 球场
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:27.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You posted
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.88,0:01:27.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你前几天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.60,EN,,0,0,0,,on your social media the other day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.84,0:01:29.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,在社交媒体上发过一句
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.08,EN,,0,0,0,,that you said fortune favors the brave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.60,0:01:32.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,天佑勇者
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:33.76,EN,,0,0,0,,I feel like that very much was the story
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.08,0:01:33.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这正是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.88,EN,,0,0,0,,of that match.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.76,0:01:34.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球的写照
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.04,EN,,0,0,0,,As that final set began progressing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.88,0:01:37.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,决胜盘一点点往下走
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.72,EN,,0,0,0,,and you started working your way back
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.04,0:01:38.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你开始一点点追回来
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.64,EN,,0,0,0,,in, did your belief just continue growing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.72,0:01:40.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,你的信念是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and growing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.64,0:01:42.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,越来越强？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:42.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:42.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.68,EN,,0,0,0,,I I always believe you know especially
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.88,0:01:45.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,我一直相信 尤其是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.72,EN,,0,0,0,,I think when I was down four five it
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.68,0:01:48.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,我 4-5 落后的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:51.52,EN,,0,0,0,,was very tough game and in that moment I
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:51.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,那一局非常难 那一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:54.24,EN,,0,0,0,,show no emotion cuz I know was never end
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:54.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,我没有表现出任何情绪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:55.92,EN,,0,0,0,,of match I just keep fighting keep
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.24,0:01:55.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为我知道比赛还没完
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:58.96,EN,,0,0,0,,going there I mean yes I think brave
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.92,0:01:58.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就一直拼 一直往前
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.16,EN,,0,0,0,,is the word today cuz
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.96,0:02:00.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,勇敢就是今天的关键词
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.32,EN,,0,0,0,,against Maddie you can't be too passive
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:02.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,对麦迪你不能太被动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.96,EN,,0,0,0,,if not she will kill you and I think I find
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.32,0:02:04.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,否则她会碾压你
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.32,EN,,0,0,0,,the right balance at the end
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.96,0:02:06.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得最后我找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.96,EN,,0,0,0,,of the game well I'm just super happy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.32,0:02:08.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,那个平衡 我特别开心
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:12.64,EN,,0,0,0,,to this match it's like Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:12.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,这场球 就是 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.16,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow. What I can say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.64,0:02:14.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 我还能说什么呢
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.80,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:17.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:21.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Qinwen, just if you wouldn't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.88,0:02:21.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,钦文 如果你不介意
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.04,EN,,0,0,0,,reflect a little bit on the journey you've
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.52,0:02:23.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,聊聊你这一路走来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.32,EN,,0,0,0,,had since the last time you played
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.04,0:02:24.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,从你上一次打美网
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.80,EN,,0,0,0,,at the US Open in 2024.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.32,0:02:26.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,那是 2024 年
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Obviously, injury issues with your elbow.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.80,0:02:29.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,后来是你的肘伤
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.72,EN,,0,0,0,,You went away, you had surgery,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.36,0:02:30.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你离开赛场 做了手术
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.00,EN,,0,0,0,,and you are fighting back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.72,0:02:32.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在一路打回来
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And you are fighting, it feels,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.00,0:02:33.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且看得出来 你打球时
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.52,EN,,0,0,0,,with a real fire in your belly,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.92,0:02:35.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,心里像有一团火
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.28,EN,,0,0,0,,especially on the back of a performance like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.52,0:02:37.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,尤其是刚打完
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.00,EN,,0,0,0,,that.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.28,0:02:38.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,这样一场之后
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Would you feel like you're close
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.00,0:02:39.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,你觉得自己是不是
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.96,EN,,0,0,0,,to being back to your best now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.60,0:02:40.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,已经接近最好的状态了？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.48,EN,,0,0,0,,because it certainly looks like it, doesn't it,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.96,0:02:42.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,因为看起来真的很像
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.72,EN,,0,0,0,,folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.48,0:02:44.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,对吧各位？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:45.60,EN,,0,0,0,,Wow. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.72,0:02:45.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,哇 是的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I just enjoy so much to play here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.60,0:02:48.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我真的很享受在这里打球
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:52.08,EN,,0,0,0,,It's like I enjoying to fight here every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.64,0:02:52.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我享受每天在这里拼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.40,EN,,0,0,0,,And after the surgery was not easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.08,0:02:54.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,手术之后并不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.88,EN,,0,0,0,,Feels like I lost a bit my energy
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.40,0:02:56.88,ZH,,0,0,0,,感觉我丢了一些能量
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.92,EN,,0,0,0,,on the tennis court.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.88,0:02:57.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.92,EN,,0,0,0,,And I've been through really tough
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.92,0:02:59.92,ZH,,0,0,0,,这三四五个月
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.36,EN,,0,0,0,,this three, four, five months.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:01.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,我过得非常难
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:04.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that's the worst period of my time
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.36,0:03:04.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得那是最糟的一段
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.60,EN,,0,0,0,,in my career since I entered to the pro.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.64,0:03:07.60,ZH,,0,0,0,,转职业以来最糟的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.68,EN,,0,0,0,,But luckily thanks to my team,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.60,0:03:09.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,幸好 谢谢我的团队
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,we've been working really hard
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.68,0:03:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们一直在很努力地练
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:14.64,EN,,0,0,0,,at the IMG Academy after Toronto.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.04,0:03:14.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,多伦多之后在 IMG 学院
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:16.24,EN,,0,0,0,,And yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.64,0:03:16.24,ZH,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:19.12,EN,,0,0,0,,the hard work pays off finally a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.24,0:03:19.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,努力终于有了一点回报
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I want to say thanks
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.12,0:03:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,我想先说声谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.12,EN,,0,0,0,,to my team first brings me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.64,0:03:23.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,谢谢团队带我走到这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Let's keep going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.12,0:03:24.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们继续往前走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.64,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, I never give up during the match.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.56,0:03:26.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,比赛里我从没放弃过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:28.96,EN,,0,0,0,,I think that's the positive things right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.64,0:03:28.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,我觉得这是最积极的一点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.56,EN,,0,0,0,,Well, listen, through qualifiers now
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.96,0:03:30.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,从资格赛一路打上来
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:31.36,EN,,0,0,0,,through to the second week
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.56,0:03:31.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在进了美网
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.32,EN,,0,0,0,,of the US Open.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.36,0:03:32.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,第二周
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:35.50,EN,,0,0,0,,Give it up for Qinwen Zheng.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.32,0:03:35.50,ZH,,0,0,0,,为郑钦文鼓掌
